      "content": "thanks, these are great. i love the \"effortless arrogance\" for julian and mac's \"grounded stillness.\" it's exactly the kind of nuance that makes a script feel high-end rather than a caricature. \n\ncould you finish isabella's description? and can you add two more characters to round out the team? maybe one who is East Asian and one who is Latino/Hispanic. i want to make sure the \"office vibes\" for those two are just as specific—like, how does their cultural background translate into how they handle pressure or interact with the senior partners? i'm looking for those subtle, recognizable personality traits that people associate with those specific backgrounds in a high-stress office.",
      "source": "evaluator"
